  "retrieved": "2026-09-11",
  "source": "Dubai Land Department Ejari rental contracts export (Kaggle mirror zainabhejairi/dubai-real-estates-1969-2023, DLD_Rents.csv, 6,585,210 contracts) + Dubai Land Department transactions export (Kaggle mirror zainabhejairi/dubai-real-estates-1969-2023, DLD_Transactions.csv)",
  "provenance": "UNOFFICIAL third-party mirror of a DLD Ejari export, 6,585,210 registered tenancy contracts. Contract volume is substantial through 2023; 2024 is partial (22,913 contracts) and is excluded. A handful of rows carry implausible years (2107+) and are discarded.",
  "period": "2021–2023",
  "minContracts": 50,
  "method": "Median annual Ejari rent per m2 divided by median registered sale price per m2 for the same community over the same window. Both sides come from registered DLD records rather than asking prices.",
  "limitation": "GROSS yield: service charges, vacancy, management and transaction costs are not deducted, and net yield is materially lower. Rent and sale samples are different properties, so unit-mix differences between the two sides add noise. Values outside 0.5–25% are discarded as bad area data.",
  "communitiesWithData": 106,
